  ('legacy:589',589,'Most asylum seekers originating','UNHCR','Displacement · population:coo:asylum_seekers','verified','95','advance_to_validation','clear_generic_legacy_block','broad_intuitive_distinct','Broad, recognizable displacement measure with a distinct player-facing question; the old generic rejection is not a sufficient reason to suppress it.','Use the recovered UNHCR Refugee Data Finder importer; validate coverage/year consistency and then clear the legacy-only blocker.','family:unhcr:most-asylum-seekers-originating','ready_for_source_family_validation'),
  ('legacy:600',600,'Lowest upper-secondary out-of-school rate','UNESCO UIS','Education · ROFST.MOD.3','verified','94','advance_to_validation','clear_generic_legacy_block','broad_intuitive_distinct','Out-of-school rates are intuitive, globally meaningful education-access measures; primary and upper-secondary provide meaningfully different stages without keeping every adjacent stage.','Validate the UNESCO UIS source-family rows and retain only these stage anchors unless later playtesting supports more.','family:unesco:lowest-upper-secondary-out-of-school','ready_for_source_family_validation'),
