  ('legacy:795',795,'Highest urban population share','World Bank','Population · SP.URB.TOTL.IN.ZS','verified','90','hold_for_family_curation','keep_reaudit_block','definition_overlap','“Urban” is definition-sensitive and the new WUP family distinguishes cities, towns and rural areas; this old aggregate wording risks mixing a different urbanization concept with the newer taxonomy.','Keep blocked until the WUP urban/city/town definition strategy is finalized; prefer explicit city/town/rural wording.','',''),
